    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know... i've talked to people. but it's like nothing changes. it's just this constant loop of trying to fix things that feel fundamentally broken. it's just so much effort to even wake up and face another day of this. i feel like i'm just wasting everyone's time by even being here.",
